	(text "MCU + reset / BOOT / debug: existing firmware GPIO map"
		(at 163.83 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1efd0e8a-e7a7-4ce1-8f47-542e1f215476")
	)
	(text "INPUTS: four keys + EC11, active-low to GND"
		(at 317.5 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "29bd407d-604a-4e0c-84a5-2f6b6272b0e0")
	)
	(text "5V_CORE must be regulated / current-limited upstream.\nNot raw USB-C / PD. 2A converter rating is not a USB power budget.\nDo not parallel this 3V3 output with future Hub regulator.\nJPOWER1 and L1 exact physical parts remain selection gates."
		(at 20.32 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37ac3de9-cb9c-4d62-b03e-060ad54a420a")
	)
	(text "Harness pin numbers are new PCB pad numbers, not the LCD FPC order.\nPreserve actual module silk CS/SCK/D0..D3 and SDA/SCL/3V3/GND.\nOne upstream I2C pull-up set only. QSPI return uses adjacent power harness."
		(at 20.32 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7584e33b-4c04-4b49-b6af-71ed4ada52c2")
	)
	(text "CORE CONTROL REVA - ELECTRICAL STUDY, NOT RELEASED FOR FAB"
		(at 20.32 332.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9c61a15e-47e6-45f1-bf78-7f5ab829152d")
	)
	(text "MCU USB FULL-SPEED / future Hub downstream P6"
		(at 251.46 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9ff2097f-309c-4260-9685-e27cc7811bfd")
	)
	(text "3V3 CONTROL RAIL: AP63203 fixed-output reference topology"
		(at 20.32 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ad31d8bb-b2e5-41e2-bb7b-80b962e0f6b8")
	)
	(text "SWJ1 POSITION_STAGE_ONLY: 1 / C / T / 2 intentionally NC.\nSpring-return lever + push; no GPIO or application action assigned.\nC is the shared contact, not connected to GND at this stage."
		(at 165.1 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c080e067-8646-414f-b4fd-5db495dfcc28")
	)
	(text "JU1 pin1 NC: no VBUS back-feed. Supply Core through JPOWER1.\nThis is an internal USB2 branch, not a USB-C receptacle / USB3 port.\nExternal test adapter must provide connector-side ESD protection.\nKeep D+/D- paired and short; final high-speed layout is a separate gate."
		(at 251.46 204.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c6e4c25f-f45c-433a-ac39-09b6a0eb6181")
	)
	(text "Select only ONE mux channel at a time. Never select 0x03 with identical slaves.\nDRV REG capacitor = 1uF; IN/TRIG = GND; EN pulled high; use I2C standby/GO.\nHAPTIC_VDD defaults to 3V3, not unregulated USB 5V. Motor rated/overdrive settings NOT verified.\nMotor OUT+/OUT- float: neither is GND. On motor six test pads, outermost two only; insulate middle four."
		(at 248.92 387.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "caa44072-e8aa-4647-a457-3ec24399da0a")
	)
	(text "Not included: USB7206C Hub, PC/Dock power mux/PD, A1/A2/FAST-C, magnetic face, Dock high-speed connector.\nThese need exact receptacle/connector pin maps, source budgets and impedance/stackup design.\nScreen assembly and EC11 use brackets/cables; motors attach to shell, not PCB pads.\nDo not synchronize this new control sheet into the old CN7/CN10 schematic or overwrite the main placement PCB."
		(at 20.32 345.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d6ce1eed-06cd-44fa-81a7-898a0c232fbb")
	)
	(text "WROOM-1 electrical pinout = WROOM-1U; explicit 1U footprint.\nN16R8: GPIO35/36/37 reserved by Octal PSRAM.\nUnused GPIOs are NC; antenna cable and antenna remain external."
		(at 163.83 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "de4d96fa-830b-433b-b88b-af50b4b0ce71")
	)
	(text "HAPTICS: mux 0x70; channel0 LEFT / channel1 RIGHT; each driver 0x5A"
		(at 248.92 219.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e2b5afb2-ca36-4839-88d1-ceebf66ad539")
	)
	(text "No duplicate screen-press GPIO39.\nFuture independent screen press is not connected.\nConnector A/B = running firmware GPIO1/GPIO2;\nhistorical physical wire labels need assembly check."
		(at 429.26 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5efde64-45ee-4a17-95ba-cfdc75d40ed4")
	)
	(text "LEFT MAG REMOVED: JG1, left protection and DET pull-up deleted.\nGPIO10 and TCA9546 CH0 are unused (NC); right MAG remains on CH1.\nLeft spring-return control: mechanical placement only, no GPIO/function allocation.\nCentral ENC_SW_GPIO39, screen, four independent keys and MIC I2S unchanged."
		(at 165.1 287.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e9d08b72-e5a2-4867-8dd8-70bf695d59e2")
	)
	(text "JA1 is the already-tested I2S amplifier interface, not the motor driver.\nMAX outputs drive only the speaker differential pair; never ground OUT-.\nJM1 pin6 straps INMP441 L/R low for LEFT; module itself provides decoupling.\nMicrophone code optional, hardware not verified; default DNP."
		(at 20.32 276.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea1e8737-d2a7-4bf1-9715-5b4e34b917c3")
	)
	(text "OPTIONAL AUDIO / MICROPHONE: keep modules external"
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea238ad6-f38a-479f-bb8f-be82c7bcff49")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY / TOUCH HARNESSES"
		(at 20.32 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f7029a7d-d5f6-4ac2-a497-b0a544dfb04c")
	)
	(text "RevC Hall acquisition | U20 address 0x48"
		(at 57 450 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e767917e-965b-47ff-8a58-d4dc811ea13a")
	)
	(text "AIN0..3 = Hall 1..4. TP20..23 provide access before each RC."
		(at 57 542 0)
		(effects
